<title>USA: Unison Health sees acquisition accretive.</title>
<headline>Unison Health sees acquisition accretive.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unison HealthCare Corp said Monday that it has reached an agreement to acquire Spine Rehabilitation and Physical Therapy Center located in Ocean Springs, Mississippi, in a transaction which it expects to be accretive to Unison's earnings.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
